    <item>
      <title>1.1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:32:48 +0300</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>The macOS Clock timer now shows in the island.</li>
          <li>Agent sessions no longer get stuck on "Working", and permission requests reach the island again.</li>
          <li>Now Playing finally reads media playing in Arc.</li>
          <li>Reworked compact bar: artwork and controls at the left edge, status behind the notch, corners matching the notch.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
